@1 = ~Thank you! Take this. We need to run away from here!~
@2 = ~Help us! They attacked us! We can't defeat them!~
@3 = ~Please, help us fight the trolls!~
@4 = ~Mistress Nalia! You're alive!~
@5 = ~By Helm! If you're here to rid this place of trolls, you must be careful. The troll that seems to lead them brought some sort of... creatures. They can confuse you simply by looking at you. They're just beyond this wall. Please, be careful. I... I need to go.~
@6 = ~Please, be careful down here.~
@7 = ~No. I was hiding down here when I heard strange noises from farther into the basement. I stayed hidden, but then I passed out. When I woke behind that chest, all was quiet. I thought the invaders had left, or that someone had come to stop them. Then I saw two other maids being attacked by those... things.~
@8 = ~They looked like a cross between a beetle and... perhaps a mantis? Huge and terrifying. When they stare at you, you go mad. The two maids began attacking each other, as if confused beyond reason. I've never seen anything like it.~
@9 = ~Farther down. I wouldn't go there if I were you. Mistress, we need to leave this place!~
@10 = ~Are you sure? Th-this place is infested with those things!~
@11 = ~All right. I wish you luck, mistress.~
@12 = ~Yes, Rhianna. Are you all right? Have you seen my father? Or anyone else?~
@13 = ~Things? What things?~
@14 = ~Where are they now?~
@15 = ~Settle down, Rhianna. We've cleared the way out. Run and don't stop, no matter what happens! We'll be right behind you. We only have something left to finish first.~
@16 = ~Trust me. Now go. I promise we'll be careful.~
